From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noxwell <beebono@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 04:39:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 146/225] ASoC: sprd: honour agcp_ahb_gpr null-check in
 iis_to_audio_top_enable

The base arch_audio_iis_to_audio_top_enable() called
agcp_ahb_gpr_null_check() but ignored its return and went on to
regmap_write() the agcp-ahb regmap. g_agcp_ahb_gpr is only set from
sprd,syscon-agcp-ahb at vbc/codec probe; an early "alsactl restore" that
replays ag_iis0_ext_sel runs vbc_put_ag_iis_ext_sel before that probe,
so the regmap is still NULL and the write NULL-derefs -> kernel panic
(regmap_write / vbc_put_ag_iis_ext_sel, Comm: alsactl).

Return -1 on a NULL regmap, matching the _v1/_v2 variants which already
do this. The control write becomes a graceful no-op until the regmap is
initialised.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/sprd/vendor/sprd-audio-agcp.h | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/sprd/vendor/sprd-audio-agcp.h b/sound/soc/sprd/vendor/sprd-audio-agcp.h
index 80fe77da9..508d9c61e 100755
--- a/sound/soc/sprd/vendor/sprd-audio-agcp.h
+++ b/sound/soc/sprd/vendor/sprd-audio-agcp.h
@@ -126,7 +126,18 @@ static inline int arch_audio_iis_to_audio_top_enable(
 	u32 val;
 	int ret;
 
-	agcp_ahb_gpr_null_check();
+	/*
+	 * Honour the null-check (the _v1/_v2 variants below already do). The
+	 * agcp-ahb regmap is set from sprd,syscon-agcp-ahb at vbc/codec probe;
+	 * if an alsactl restore writes ag_iisN_ext_sel before that probe has
+	 * run, g_agcp_ahb_gpr is still NULL and the reg write NULL-derefs
+	 * (kernel panic via vbc_put_ag_iis_ext_sel). Bail gracefully instead.
+	 */
+	ret = agcp_ahb_gpr_null_check();
+	if (ret) {
+		pr_err("%s agcp_ahb_gpr_null_check failed!", __func__);
+		return -1;
+	}
 
 	switch (iis) {
 	case AG_IIS0:
